Redface 2 v0.40.0 — beta.

- Smiley picker: 5 columns on every phone and much larger custom smileys, plus an optional cell delimiter.
- Flags: a topic whose last read post ended a page now opens on the next page, where the first unread post actually is.
- New: "Set an HFR bookmark here" in a post's menu, with a confirmation when the topic already has one elsewhere.
